+# FAA directives case files and correspondence manual accessions
+
+November 9, 2026 Eastern · B129 / PD01–PD04. National Archives accession notices identify **six specific directives-file accessions** whose listed dates include 1985, the year FAA Order **1360.16** was issued. Two College Park accession IDs and four regional accession IDs give concrete routes to a folder list for the 1985 correspondence manual and its approval file. Separately, three FAA internal-publication accessions cover May 2003, 2006, or both. The notices give container-level metadata. The manual, its clearance file and the correction and decision records remain unacquired. [1985 order locator and prior FAA policy comparison](https://github.com/AveLyra/911-conspiracy-investigation/blob/7dcb6c28f8c4496148f11406570140b3c18e9eda/investigation/broader-evidence/faa-correspondence-predecessor-and-mail-controls-2026-11-08/README.md) · [Pinned accession rows](SOURCE-PINS.json)
+
